## PHP 8.3–8.4

::: {#0d0ce6ae .cell execution_count=3}
``` {.php .cell-code}
$mpg = DataFrame::fromRows(Datasets::mpg());

$byClass = phplyr($mpg)
    ->groupBy('class')
    ->summarize(cars: n(), hwy: round(mean('hwy'), 1))
    ->arrange(desc('hwy'))
    ->get();

$byClass;
```

